==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*komdoukō}}. Equivalent to {{prefix|la|con|dūcō|t2=lead}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|condūcō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|irreg|condūcō}}

# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[lead]], [[bring]] or [[draw]] together; [[assemble]], [[collect]]
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[connect]], [[join]], [[unite]]; [[close up]]; [[coagulate]]
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[hire]], [[rent]], [[employ]], take on [[lease]], [[undertake]]; [[farm]]; [[bribe]]
# {{lb|la|intransitive}} to be [[conducive]] to, [[contribute]] to something by being [[useful]], to be of use or [[profitable]], [[serve]]

